<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ILEX Oncology started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ILEX Oncology started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it initiated coverage of ILEX Oncology Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- set a three-year price target of $42 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- expects ILEX to post a loss of $0.25 a share in 1997.</p>
<p>-- ILEX was unchanged at 12-3/8.</p>
</text>
